@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Document Search with Ollama

autonumber

actor User
participant "Web UI / CLI" as Client
participant "WebSocketHandler" as WS
participant "SearchService" as Search
participant "OllamaClient" as Ollama
participant "Ollama LLM" as LLM
participant "InvertedIndex" as Index

User -> Client: Enter search query
Client -> WS: /ws/search {query}
activate WS

WS -> Search: search(query)
activate Search

Search -> Ollama: expandQuery(query)
activate Ollama

Ollama -> LLM: POST /api/generate
activate LLM
LLM --> Ollama: Expanded keywords
deactivate LLM

Ollama --> Search: Expanded terms
deactivate Ollama

Search --> WS: Query expansion data
WS --> Client: stage: query_expansion

loop For each expanded term
    Search -> Index: search(term)
    activate Index
    Index --> Search: Matching documents
    deactivate Index
end

Search -> Search: Merge and rank results

Search --> WS: Ranked search results
deactivate Search

WS --> Client: stage: keyword_search
WS --> Client: stage: done
deactivate WS

Client --> User: Display search results
@enduml